title: HTTP endpoint
kind: overview
audience: dev
summary: Every route of the daemon's and the GUI's HTTP servers, one note per method and path.

Both servers listen on loopback only. The daemon's routes all need the session token;
the GUI's only `/gui/*` and the routes that serve file contents ([[Session tokens]]).
UUIDs are 32-character lowercase hex, and an error is `{"error": "…"}` with its status.
Each note is tagged with the group that describes its bodies and answers in context:

* the daemon — [[Repository endpoints]], [[Metarecord endpoints]], [[Query endpoints]], [[Tree endpoints]], [[Log endpoints]], [[Rollback endpoints]], [[Revert endpoints]], [[Schema endpoints]], [[Task endpoints]], [[Watcher endpoints]], [[Health and diagnostics]];
* the GUI — [[GUI scripting endpoints]], [[GUI file endpoints]], [[GUI asset endpoints]].

